--- !u!114 &1498612667
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1498612666}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6f6563ddd4f3c4370884b2c6c26c95a7, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TapePlayer
  captionUI: {fileID: 833696653}
  audioSource: {fileID: 0}
  tvGlowObject: {fileID: 1719104716}
  tvGlowMaterial: {fileID: 2100000, guid: 668a5b1d7eef84f468ba87031c052fc0, type: 2}
  tvScreenRenderer: {fileID: 1719104718}
  warningCaption: YOU CAN'T DO A SINGLE THING PROPERLY AND YOU'RE SAYING I CAN HANDLE EVERYTHING?!
  tape1Audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7795ad7b4653a41b0bcbcbd28c45e85e, type: 3}
  tape1Script: 'Hey.|1.5

    I know you said you were going to call, but you probably forgot again.|4.0

    You''ve been doing that a lot lately. Forgetting things. Or remembering them differently.|5.0

    Yesterday you told me we never had that conversation, but I remember it. You changed what you said halfway through, too.|6.5

    I don''t know. Maybe you''re just tired.|3.0

    Anyway, don''t move everything around again, okay? I finally know where everything is.|5.5

    Your keys are on the desk. I left them there for you.|3.5

    And... I think that''s it.|2.5

    Call me when you get back.|3.0

'
  tape1Time: 2
  tape2Audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 42af47893a5e24d12b388509062902cb, type: 3}
  tape2Script: "WIFE: You barely come home anymore.|1.5\nHUSBAND: You knew what you signed up for.|2.0\nWIFE: And when you do, you're not really here.|2.0\nHUSBAND: I'm fine.|1.0\nWIFE: I know what your work does to you.|2.0\nHUSBAND: I said I'm fine.|1.4\nWIFE: You don't talk about it. You don't have to.|2.0\nHUSBAND: You don't know what you're talking about.|2.0\nWIFE: The way you sleep.|1.0\nWIFE: The way you wake up.|1.0\nWIFE: The way you look at people.|1.5\nWIFE: You're angry all the time.|1.5\nHUSBAND: Stop.|1.0\nWIFE: I'm trying to help you.|1.5\nHUSBAND: I said stop talking about it.|1.5\nWIFE: Then quit.|1.5\nHUSBAND: YOU THINK I CAN JUST QUIT?|2.1\nWIFE: Please. You don't need this anymore.|2.3\nHUSBAND: You think I can just walk away?|2.1\nWIFE: You need to come home.|2.0\nHUSBAND: You have no idea what I've seen.|2.2\nHUSBAND: You have no idea what I've had to do.|2.6\nWIFE: You need to let yourself be here.|2.2\nHUSBAND: Don't tell me what I need.|2.0\nWIFE: I'm your wife.|1.8\nWIFE: I'm not your enemy.|1.5\nWIFE: You don't even see me anymore.|2.1\nHUSBAND: I'm doing what I have to do.|2.1\nWIFE: You see threats everywhere.|2.1\nWIFE: You see enemies everywhere.|2.2\nHUSBAND: I'm protecting you.|1.7\nWIFE: And every time I try to reach you, you push me away.|2.8\nHUSBAND: I'm protecting us.|1.7\nWIFE: You weren't always like this.|1.9\nHUSBAND: I'm not angry.|1.6\nWIFE: I miss the person you used to be.|2.3\nHUSBAND: I'm not.|1.1\nWIFE: I don't know how much longer I can do this.|2.7\nHUSBAND: Don't.|1.0\nWIFE: You need help.|1.4\nHUSBAND: I'm not\u2014|0.9\nWIFE: You need to leave that life behind before it destroys what's left of you.|3.6\nHUSBAND: Enough.|1.2\nWIFE: Look at me. Just look at me.|1.8\nHUSBAND: I said stop.|1.7\nWIFE: You're not listening.|1.6\nWIFE: You're so angry that you don't even know what you're becoming.|3.1\nHUSBAND: Don't say that.|1.4\nHUSBAND: You don't know me.|1.4\nHUSBAND: After everything I've done...|1.7\nWIFE: You're becoming someone who doesn't feel anything.|2.5\nHUSBAND: After everything I've done to keep you safe...|2.4\nWIFE: Someone who can't love anyone.|1.9\nHUSBAND: You think I don't care?|1.6\nWIFE: You have no heart anymore.|1.9\nHUSBAND: I said shut up.|1.6\nHUSBAND: I\u2014|1.5\nWIFE: Please, put the knife down!|2.2\n[Static cuts out]|2.5\n"
  tape2Time: 1
  clockController: {fileID: 1223324282}
  roomStateManager: {fileID: 0}
